			"isDeleted": false,
			"boundElements": [],
			"updated": 1760124059561,
			"link": null,
			"locked": false,
			"text": "- Partitioning and consistent hashing allow cassandra to scale.\n\n- Replication gives it the availability and fault tolerance.\n\n- Gossip and its leaderless design keep the cluster decentralized and self-healing.\n\n- And tunable consistency lets you control how it balances correctness and uptime — per\nrequest.",
			"fontSize": 20.013800905396263,
			"fontFamily": 8,
			"textAlign": "left",
			"verticalAlign": "top",
			"containerId": null,
			"originalText": "- Partitioning and consistent hashing allow cassandra to scale.\n\n- Replication gives it the availability and fault tolerance.\n\n- Gossip and its leaderless design keep the cluster decentralized and self-healing.\n\n- And tunable consistency lets you control how it balances correctness and uptime — per request.",
			"autoResize": false,
